# Financial Friday Roadmap

## Purpose

The Financial Friday Roadmap provides a high-level view of the project's evolution from concept to production.

It defines the major milestones, objectives, and deliverables for each version while communicating the long-term vision of Financial Friday.

The roadmap is intended to guide development rather than prescribe exact implementation details. Milestones may evolve as the project grows and new insights are gained.

---

# Guiding Principle

Build the right foundation before building features.

Each milestone should reduce uncertainty and prepare the project for the next stage of development.

---

# Project Vision

Financial Friday is being built to become the world's most trusted AI financial advisor.

The roadmap reflects a philosophy of building intelligence first, followed by architecture, implementation, integration, and continuous improvement.

