# Milestone Overview

## v0.5.0 — Advisor Intelligence Specification

### Objective

Define how the Advisor should think.

### Deliverables

- Financial Friday Constitution
- Vision & Mission
- Advisor Intelligence Specification (AIS)
- Codebase Audit

---

## v0.6.0 — Advisor Architecture Blueprint

### Objective

Design how the Advisor will be built.

### Deliverables

- Advisor System Architecture
- Recommendation Pipeline
- Domain Model
- Core Data Objects
- Engine Interfaces
- Sequence Diagrams
- Advisor Architecture Blueprint

---

## v0.7.0 — Advisor Kernel

### Objective

Implement the Advisor's core reasoning engine.

### Deliverables

- Advisor orchestration
- Recommendation engine
- Priority engine
- Confidence engine
- Transparency engine
- Memory engine
- Goal engine
- Story engine
- Operating mode engine

---

## v0.8.0 — Data Layer & Financial Integrations

### Objective

Connect the Advisor to real financial information.

### Deliverables

- Account aggregation
- Transaction ingestion
- Budget synchronization
- Investment data
- Categorization improvements
- Historical financial storage

---

## v0.9.0 — Advisor MVP

### Objective

Deliver the first complete end-to-end Advisor experience.

### Deliverables

- Advisor chat interface
- Personalized recommendations
- Goal management
- Financial story
- Emergency mode
- Opportunity detection
- Transparency explanations
- End-to-end testing

---

## v1.0.0 — Public Release

### Objective

Release Financial Friday as a production-ready AI financial advisor.

### Deliverables

- Production infrastructure
- Security hardening
- Performance optimization
- Comprehensive testing
- Documentation
- Public launch

