# Long-Term Vision

Following Version 1.0, Financial Friday will continue evolving through incremental releases focused on:

- Expanded financial institution support
- Improved personalization
- Advanced forecasting
- Tax planning
- Retirement planning
- Business finance
- Family financial management
- AI model improvements
- Continuous recommendation refinement

---

# Success Philosophy

Financial Friday measures success by improving users' financial well-being rather than simply delivering software features.

Every milestone should move the Advisor closer to becoming a trusted, transparent, and intelligent financial partner.

---

# Roadmap Maintenance

The roadmap is a living document.

As priorities evolve and new capabilities emerge, milestones may be refined while remaining faithful to the Financial Friday Constitution, Vision & Mission, and Advisor Intelligence Specification.
